1760 DATA "WHY ARE YOU INTERESTED IN WHETHER OR NOT I AM*"
1770 DATA "WOULD YOU PREFER IF I WERE NOT*"
1780 DATA "PERHAPS IN YOUR FANTASIES I AM*"
1790 DATA "HOW DO YOU KNOW YOU CAN'T*"
1800 DATA "HAVE YOU TRIED?"
1810 DATA "PERHAPS YOU CAN NOW*"
1820 DATA "DID YOU COME TO ME BECAUSE YOU ARE*"
