2410 DATA "COULD THERE REALLY BE SOME CONNECTION?"
2420 DATA "HOW?"
2430 DATA "YOU SEEM QUITE POSITIVE."
2440 DATA "ARE YOU SURE?"
2450 DATA "I SEE."
2460 DATA "I UNDERSTAND."
2470 DATA "WHY DO YOU BRING UP THE TOPIC OF FRIENDS?"
2480 DATA "DO YOUR FRIENDS WORRY YOU?"
